                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Statistical formulations or analyses which, when applied to data and found to fit the data, are then used to verify the assumptions and parameters used in the analysis. Examples of statistical models are the linear model, binomial model, polynomial model, two-parameter model, etc.</dd>
                </span>
            
            <dt>Entry Version</dt><dd>MODELS STATIST</dd>
        
